# One Island is the only other land Bot1 controls when the Outpost enters. Bot2 has a Mountain, but it does not count, and the Outpost itself is not an "other" land; it enters tapped and no choice triggers (CR 614.1d, 603.6a).
[Bot1 Deck]
Federation Outpost
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Federation Outpost.Play

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Federation Outpost
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Federation Outpost.Tapped = true
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot2.Life = 20
